{"reviewId": "4613987_87T4i6LVw", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "现在2026年，俄乌战争继续，美以伊战争开始，第五次预估的不准，但是开始时1991年，按之前的算20年，现在岂不是妥妥妥的衰退期，那完后基本到2060年全是萧条和回升", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "1973年以前参见雅各布·范杜因，​《创新随时间的波动》​，​《现代外国经济学论文选（第十辑）​》​，商务印书馆，1986年。", "range": "3088-3146", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "4613987_87T4i6LVw", "userVid": 4613987, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774500092, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 4613987, "name": "wq ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLAWosX6n1ezwpR7s0zCLxqOUGe5Wg3efibTSNE4EREu9seI5nmngfhRZt7pgbTqIEBT4cSaJSiabsAw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 289569000, "name": "sandy", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/hp3STNiaMicGgcA4JdnZhZf0aib2by3fXmoWoBPTfPIYBdqYDjliaNDqzOsHgMjet4KQqb5F2CicSwCJ8tNyJnuV8mtMKTvzWYtKlgKzE9Pa1pSo/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "确实不太准，互联网泡沫也是萧条期是在2001年，比预估的早了，繁荣1期没那么长", "reviewId": "4613987_87T4i6LVw", "commentId": "4613987_87T4i6LVw_c445244616_8bfYOeKWN", "userVid": 445244616, "createTime": 1786366319, "author": {"userVid": 445244616, "name": "Estelle.T", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83ep